check assertRequestProcessorClearance for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
check assertRoleAssignmentClearance for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
check assertDelegationClearance for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
check assertRolePersistence for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
check assertDelegationPersistence for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
check assertNoSelfDelegation for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
check assertNoSelfApproval for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
